;; Ryu's mini game, Shadow Duel: seven screens of a moonlit ninja stage, then the Masked Ninja's
;; dojo. stage.ts loads it with ?raw, so it is not in the level library, the dev level select or
;; the campaign. Rows 0-1 stay empty under the Ninja Gaiden HUD.
;;
;; The route, built around Ryu's wall cling (hold toward a wall in the air to cling, JUMP to kick
;; off it; holding toward the wall again brings him back to it higher up):
;;   the street (lanterns, a knife thrower) -> building A (columns 20-27, 7 tiles high: climb
;;   its left face) -> its roof, a drop to the ground (a dog, a hawk, a knife thrower) -> the
;;   shaft: a 5-high pillar (50-51) and the 9-high tower (55-63) three tiles apart: climb the
;;   pillar, then kick between the two faces up onto the tower -> the drop to the pits (two
;;   2-wide pits at 70 and 76, nothing hostile within ten tiles of them) -> the yard (a hawk,
;;   a knife thrower, a dog) -> the last wall (104-107, the art lantern on top) -> the dojo
;;   (columns 112-127: its left wall's doorway, rows 10-12, shuts behind Ryu).
;; Lanterns, creatures and the boss are the mini game's own entity types (World's extraEntities,
;; stage.ts); `masked` is taken out of the map and placed by the scene.
id: ng-shadow-duel
name: SHADOW DUEL
world: 6
stage: 2
theme: ninja-night
music: ng-stage
time: 300
start: 2,12
startMode: stand
camera: scroll

